# on the CPU: it binds 1000 storage buffers and the device binds at most 999
# A GPU block that draws and fits no device: a bind group has at most 1000
# bindings, so a device binds at most 999 storage buffers. The block reads
# 500 components and its nested `each` 499, which would fit; its records
# make 1000, so it runs on the CPU. Its draws keep their place between an
# ordinary system's under them and another's over them, in two tables.

component Spot
  x: Float32
  y: Float32
end

tag Big

